{
  "name": "dsh-valley-meter",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "峰谷电表：DeepSeek Harness 用量小助手，已适配 DSH 0.2（0.2.1-rc.2）。输入框上方一枚极简余额徽章（框内只有「¥ + 余额数字」两组，点击 ¥ 在新页签打开官方充值页），悬停浮现 24 小时峰谷时间轴（橙=峰、蓝=谷）；按官方规则处理周末全天低谷（2026-08-23 起周六周日全天按低谷价计费，界面与计费同步）；官方余额 5 秒实时刷新，今日消耗独立计费。All-in-one DeepSeek peak/valley meter for DSH 0.2: minimal balance chip with a one-click top-up link, hover 24h peak/valley timeline, official weekend all-off-peak rule, 5s balance refresh and independent spend metering.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "types": "./lib/types/client/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./typert": {
      "default": "./lib/typert.host.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "dshhub": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "displayName": "dsh-valley-meter",
    "summary": "峰谷电表：输入框上方余额数字徽章，悬停浮现 24 小时峰谷时间轴（峰橙/谷蓝 + 当前时刻指针），官方余额 5 秒刷新、今日消耗独立计费，10 套配色预置。已适配 DSH 0.2。",
    "categories": [
      "费用",
      "Web UI",
      "观测"
    ],
    "surfaces": [
      "host",
      "web"
    ],
    "capabilities": {
      "provides": [
        "service:valley-meter"
      ]
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.1",
      "node": ">=20"
    },
    "permissions": {
      "network": [
        "https://api.deepseek.com"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.plugin.json",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "test": "node --test",
    "check": "node --check lib/index.js && node --check lib/client.js && node --check lib/typert.host.js && node --test && node build.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "~4.0.5"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-typert-protocol": "0.2.1-rc.2",
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-0.2",
    "client-plugin",
    "cost",
    "peak",
    "valley",
    "off-peak",
    "weekend",
    "balance",
    "countdown",
    "费用",
    "峰谷",
    "波谷",
    "倒计时",
    "余额"
  ],
  "author": "istone <ad571@qq.com>",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/uckkk/dsh-valley-meter.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/uckkk/dsh-valley-meter#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/uckkk/dsh-valley-meter/issues"
  }
}
